2:T11e5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","headline":"How to Choose the Best IPTV Service in the UK","description":"How to pick the best IPTV service in the UK: the eight things that actually separate a good provider from a bad one, the claims to distrust, and what to test during a free trial before you pay.","image":"https://iptvuk.buzz/images/guides/best-iptv-uk.svg","dateModified":"2026-08-14","mainEntityOfPage":"https://iptvuk.buzz/best-iptv-uk","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz/best-iptv-uk","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"IPTV UK","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz/icon.svg"}},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"IPTV UK","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://iptvuk.buzz/icon.svg"}}},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best IPTV service in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no single answer, and any list claiming otherwise is usually ranking whoever paid to appear on it. What matters is whether a service carries both Sky Sports and TNT Sports, holds up on a busy evening, has a working programme guide, answers support messages, and lets you test all of that without card details. Trial two or three services in the same week and judge them yourself."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much should an IPTV subscription cost in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most UK services fall between roughly £5 and £15 a month depending on how long you commit for. Be wary at both ends: prices far below that range tend to signal a service that will not last the year, and prices far above it are rarely buying anything extra. Our plans run from £14.99."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a free IPTV trial actually free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It should be. A genuine trial takes no card details, has no checkout and nothing that renews — when it ends, access simply stops. If a provider asks for payment details up front, that is a subscription with a cancellation deadline rather than a trial."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are IPTV channel counts real?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Rarely, and not because providers are all lying — nobody counts the same way. Some count every regional variant and timeshift separately, some include feeds that have not worked in a year. Fifty working UK channels are worth more than forty thousand listed ones, so judge by what plays during the trial."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is IPTV legal in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"IPTV as a technology is entirely legal, and Sky Stream, NOW, BBC iPlayer and ITVX are all delivered this way. Legality turns on whether a provider holds the rights to distribute what it carries, which is a question about the provider rather than about IPTV. Ask any service you are considering directly, and note that watching live television in the UK requires a TV Licence regardless of who you pay."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need a VPN for IPTV in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not usually. A VPN helps if your ISP is shaping or blocking streaming traffic, but it cannot create bandwidth, so it does nothing for weak Wi-Fi or a slow device. Test the service without one first — our buffering guide explains how to tell which problem you actually have."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I test during a free trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Book it for a busy evening, time how long support takes to reply to a real question, check the programme guide is accurate, watch one full match rather than sampling ten channels, test every device in the house, and search for your specific channels in the player rather than on the sales page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I know a provider will still exist in six months?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You cannot know for certain, which is an argument for shorter plans until a service has proved itself. A written refund policy, a status page, responsive support and honesty about limitations are the signals worth weighing. \"Lifetime\" subscriptions are the clearest warning sign in this market."}}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://iptvuk.buzz"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Guides","item":"https://iptvuk.buzz/guides"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Best IPTV UK","item":"https://iptvuk.buzz/best-iptv-uk"}]}]}6:["guideSlug","best-iptv-uk","d"]
0:["RY_UPppDLJkoDEu4eNkVz",[[["",{"children":[["guideSlug","best-iptv-uk","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"guideSlug\":\"best-iptv-uk\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["guideSlug","best-iptv-uk","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"bg-white text-slate-900","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 text-white","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_rgba(249,115,22,0.25),_transparent_45%),radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_right,_rgba(14,165,233,0.2),_transparent_45%)]"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-16","children":[["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/","className":"transition hover:text-orange-300","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2 text-slate-600","children":"/"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/guides","className":"transition hover:text-orange-300","children":"Guides"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2 text-slate-600","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-300","children":"Buying Guide"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex rounded-full border border-orange-400/30 bg-orange-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-orange-200","children":"Buying Guide"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-5xl","children":"How to Choose the Best IPTV Service in the UK"}],[["$","p","Search for the best IPTV service in the ",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg","children":"Search for the best IPTV service in the UK and you will find dozens of lists, most of them ranking providers that paid to appear on them. The channel counts are enormous, the prices are suspiciously similar, and none of it tells you whether a given service will still be working in March."}],["$","p","This guide takes the opposite approach. ",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg","children":"This guide takes the opposite approach. Rather than ranking providers, it sets out what actually separates a service worth paying for from one that will disappear — and gives you a test plan you can run yourself, for free, in a single evening."}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-400","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"12 min read"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-600","children":"•"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Updated ",["$","time",null,{"dateTime":"2026-08-14","children":"14 August 2026"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","Eight buying criteria",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"Eight buying criteria"}],["$","span","Claims that should worry you",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"Claims that should worry you"}],["$","span","A trial-day test plan",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"A trial-day test plan"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 shadow-[0_35px_100px_-45px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/guides/best-iptv-uk.svg","alt":"A checklist of IPTV buying criteria beside a live channel guide on a television","width":1200,"height":630,"className":"h-auto w-full","fetchPriority":"high"}]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-16","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_270px] lg:gap-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-w-0","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"We sell an IPTV subscription, so treat this as a guide written by an interested party and check every claim against the trial rather than taking our word for it. That is the entire point of the criteria below: all of them are things you can verify yourself before paying anyone, including us."}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"criteria","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"The Eight Things That Actually Matter"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"Channel counts and price are the two things every provider advertises and the two that predict least. These eight predict considerably more."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","article","1. A trial with no card details",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"1. A trial with no card details"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 rounded-full bg-orange-50 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-orange-600","children":"Non-negotiable"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"A provider confident in its service will let you test it before taking anything. If a \"free trial\" requires card details, it is a subscription with a cancellation deadline, and forgetting that deadline is the business model. No card, no checkout, nothing that renews."}]]}],["$","article","2. Both sports packages",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"2. Both sports packages"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Sky Sports and TNT Sports hold different rights. A service carrying only one leaves you without Champions League football or without the Premier League, depending which half is missing. Search their channel list for both before you go near a payment page."}]]}],["$","article","3. Performance under load, not at 11am",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"3. Performance under load, not at 11am"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Any service looks fine on a quiet Tuesday morning. The question is Saturday at 3pm and Tuesday at 8pm on a European night. If a trial cannot be scheduled around a real fixture, that tells you something."}]]}],["$","article","4. A working programme guide",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"4. A working programme guide"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"A full EPG is a good proxy for how much work goes into the service generally. Anyone can point a player at a stream. Keeping seven days of accurate listings mapped to the right channels is ongoing effort, and a missing or wrong guide usually means the rest is neglected too."}]]}],["$","article","5. A human who answers",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"5. A human who answers"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Something will go wrong eventually — a channel drops, a device resets, a MAC address changes. What matters is whether a person replies. Message support with a real question before you buy and time the response."}]]}],["$","article","6. A written refund policy",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"6. A written refund policy"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Not a promise in a chat window: a policy on the site stating the window and what qualifies. Providers without one are telling you what happens when you ask for money back."}]]}],["$","article","7. Your devices, specifically",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"7. Your devices, specifically"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Firestick and Android are easy. Samsung Tizen and LG webOS are where thin services fall down, because app availability keeps changing. If you have a Smart TV, confirm your exact model works before paying rather than after."}]]}],["$","article","8. Honest limits",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-slate-900","children":"8. Honest limits"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"A provider that tells you what it cannot do — 3pm blackouts, how many simultaneous streams, which channels are missing — is more likely to be accurate about what it can. Uniform perfection in the sales copy is the warning sign."}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"red-flags","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Claims That Should Make You Cautious"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"Some marketing language is universal in this industry and worth translating."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":[null,["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.6)]","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left text-sm","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-slate-900 text-white","children":[["$","th","The claim",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"The claim"}],["$","th","What it usually means",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"What it usually means"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","\"Every Premier League match live\"",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","\"Every Premier League match live\"-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"\"Every Premier League match live\""}],["$","td","\"Every Premier League match live\"-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Not possible in the UK. Saturday 3pm fixtures are not broadcast domestically at all."}]]}],["$","tr","\"99.99% uptime guaranteed\"",{"className":"bg-slate-50","children":[["$","td","\"99.99% uptime guaranteed\"-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"\"99.99% uptime guaranteed\""}],["$","td","\"99.99% uptime guaranteed\"-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"An unverifiable number. Ask instead whether there is a status page you can check."}]]}],["$","tr","\"Lifetime subscription\"",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","\"Lifetime subscription\"-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"\"Lifetime subscription\""}],["$","td","\"Lifetime subscription\"-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Lifetime of the provider, which in this market is frequently measured in months."}]]}],["$","tr","\"40,000+ channels\"",{"className":"bg-slate-50","children":[["$","td","\"40,000+ channels\"-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"\"40,000+ channels\""}],["$","td","\"40,000+ channels\"-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Padded with hundreds of duplicates and dead feeds. Fifty working UK channels beat forty thousand listed ones."}]]}],["$","tr","\"Free trial\" that wants a card",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","\"Free trial\" that wants a card-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"\"Free trial\" that wants a card"}],["$","td","\"Free trial\" that wants a card-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"A subscription with a cancellation deadline you are expected to miss."}]]}],["$","tr","\"No VPN needed, guaranteed\"",{"className":"bg-slate-50","children":[["$","td","\"No VPN needed, guaranteed\"-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"\"No VPN needed, guaranteed\""}],["$","td","\"No VPN needed, guaranteed\"-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Nobody can guarantee this — it depends on your ISP, not on them."}]]}],["$","tr","Trustpilot badge that is not clickable",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","Trustpilot badge that is not clickable-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"Trustpilot badge that is not clickable"}],["$","td","Trustpilot badge that is not clickable-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Check the actual profile. An image of a rating is not a rating."}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-5 py-4 border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-950","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70","children":"On channel counts, including ours"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 mt-2","children":"Nobody counts channels the same way. Some count every regional variant and timeshift as separate; others count dead feeds that have not worked in a year. Treat every headline number across the industry as marketing rather than measurement, and judge a service by what plays during the trial."}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"legality","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"The Question Underneath All of This"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"IPTV as a technology is entirely legal in the UK, and major broadcasters use it to deliver their own services — Sky Stream, NOW, BBC iPlayer and ITVX are all delivered over the internet."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"What determines legality is whether the provider holds the rights to distribute what it carries. That is a question about the provider, not about IPTV, and it is a question worth asking directly of anyone you are considering, including us. A provider that will not answer it plainly has told you the answer."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-5 py-4 border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 text-sky-950","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70","children":"Also worth knowing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 mt-2","children":"If you watch live television in the UK, on any device and through any service, you need a TV Licence. That obligation attaches to you and the act of watching, and it is separate from whatever you pay any provider."}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"test-plan","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"The Trial-Day Test Plan"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"This is the part worth actually doing. A 24-hour trial is enough to answer every question above if you use it deliberately rather than scrolling the channel list for ten minutes."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-4","children":[["$","li","Book the trial for a busy evening",{"className":"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":1}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":"Book the trial for a busy evening"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 mt-1","children":"A Saturday afternoon during the football, or a midweek European night. Testing at 10am on a Wednesday tells you nothing about how the service behaves when it matters."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Time the support response before anything else",{"className":"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":2}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":"Time the support response before anything else"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 mt-1","children":"Send a real question when you request the trial. How long the reply takes, and whether it answers the question, is the most reliable predictor of what support will be like in six months."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Check the guide, not just the channels",{"className":"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":3}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":"Check the guide, not just the channels"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 mt-1","children":"Open the EPG and confirm it shows accurate now-and-next for the days ahead, mapped to the right channels. This is where thin services are exposed fastest."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Watch one full match end to end",{"className":"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":4}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":"Watch one full match end to end"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 mt-1","children":"Not thirty seconds of ten channels. A complete fixture is the only way to see whether it holds up through a second half when everyone else is watching too."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Test every device in the house",{"className":"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":5}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":"Test every device in the house"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 mt-1","children":"The television, the tablet, the phone. Confirm the number of simultaneous streams matches what you were told, because this is where plans differ most."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Search for your specific channels",{"className":"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":6}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":"Search