on-orange-300 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-orange-700","children":"Sky Sports page"}]," covers the sport in detail."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","article","Test on a match night",{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 to-slate-800 p-5 text-white shadow-[0_25px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.9)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300","children":"If you want sport"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg font-black","children":"Test on a match night"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Both sports packages matter, and so does performance under load. Book the trial for a fixture rather than a quiet afternoon."}]]}],["$","article","Confirm your model first",{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 to-slate-800 p-5 text-white shadow-[0_25px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.9)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300","children":"If you have a Smart TV"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg font-black","children":"Confirm your model first"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Samsung and LG app availability changes. Send your exact model number before paying anyone, not after."}]]}],["$","article","Check the notice period",{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 to-slate-800 p-5 text-white shadow-[0_25px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.9)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300","children":"If you are leaving Sky"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg font-black","children":"Check the notice period"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300","children":"Sky contracts carry notice periods and equipment returns. Line up the dates before you cancel anything."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3","children":[["$","$L4","Start a free 24-hour trial",{"href":"/iptv-uk-free-trial","className":"rounded-full bg-orange-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-orange-600","children":"Start a free 24-hour trial"}],["$","$L4","Compare plans",{"href":"/pricing","className":"rounded-full bg-orange-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-orange-600","children":"Compare plans"}]]}]],["$","section",null,{"id":"faq","className":"mt-14 scroll-mt-24","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-3","children":[["$","details","What is the best IPTV service in the UK?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is the best IPTV service in the UK?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"There is no single answer, and any list claiming otherwise is usually ranking whoever paid to appear on it. What matters is whether a service carries both Sky Sports and TNT Sports, holds up on a busy evening, has a working programme guide, answers support messages, and lets you test all of that without card details. Trial two or three services in the same week and judge them yourself."}]]}],["$","details","How much should an IPTV subscription cost in the UK?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How much should an IPTV subscription cost in the UK?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Most UK services fall between roughly £5 and £15 a month depending on how long you commit for. Be wary at both ends: prices far below that range tend to signal a service that will not last the year, and prices far above it are rarely buying anything extra. Our plans run from £14.99."}]]}],["$","details","Is a free IPTV trial actually free?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is a free IPTV trial actually free?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"It should be. A genuine trial takes no card details, has no checkout and nothing that renews — when it ends, access simply stops. If a provider asks for payment details up front, that is a subscription with a cancellation deadline rather than a trial."}]]}],["$","details","Are IPTV channel counts real?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Are IPTV channel counts real?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Rarely, and not because providers are all lying — nobody counts the same way. Some count every regional variant and timeshift separately, some include feeds that have not worked in a year. Fifty working UK channels are worth more than forty thousand listed ones, so judge by what plays during the trial."}]]}],["$","details","Is IPTV legal in the UK?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is IPTV legal in the UK?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"IPTV as a technology is entirely legal, and Sky Stream, NOW, BBC iPlayer and ITVX are all delivered this way. Legality turns on whether a provider holds the rights to distribute what it carries, which is a question about the provider rather than about IPTV. Ask any service you are considering directly, and note that watching live television in the UK requires a TV Licence regardless of who you pay."}]]}],["$","details","Do I need a VPN for IPTV in the UK?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Do I need a VPN for IPTV in the UK?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Not usually. A VPN helps if your ISP is shaping or blocking streaming traffic, but it cannot create bandwidth, so it does nothing for weak Wi-Fi or a slow device. Test the service without one first — our buffering guide explains how to tell which problem you actually have."}]]}],["$","details","What should I test during a free trial?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What should I test during a free trial?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Book it for a busy evening, time how long support takes to reply to a real question, check the programme guide is accurate, watch one full match rather than sampling ten channels, test every device in the house, and search for your specific channels in the player rather than on the sales page."}]]}],["$","details","How do I know a provider will still exist in six months?",{"className":"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-base","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How do I know a provider will still exist in six months?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-lg text-slate-400 transition group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"You cannot know for certain, which is an argument for shorter plans until a service has proved itself. A written refund policy, a status page, responsive support and honesty about limitations are the signals worth weighing. \"Lifetime\" subscriptions are the clearest warning sign in this market."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-slate-800 p-7 text-white shadow-[0_35px_100px_-50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.9)] sm:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-orange-300","children":"Next step"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl","children":"Run the test plan on us first"}],[["$","p","Take the free 24-hour trial, work throug",{"className":"mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-base","children":"Take the free 24-hour trial, work through the test plan above, and hold us to every criterion on this page. No card details, no checkout, nothing that renews."}],["$","p","Trial two or three services in the same ",{"className":"mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-base","children":"Trial two or three services in the same week while you are at it. An hour of testing on your own hardware is a better guide than any ranked list, including this one. If we fail a test, you have lost nothing but an evening."}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://wa.me/447490301370?text=Hi%2C%20I'd%20like%20a%2024%20Hours%20Free%20Trial%20to%20run%20through%20your%20test%20plan.","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","className":"rounded-full bg-emerald-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-600","children":"Claim 24hr Free Trial"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/pricing","className":"rounded-full bg-orange-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-orange-600","children":"See Plans & Pricing"}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/channels","className":"rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10","children":"Browse Channels"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"lg